Top Calendar Apps: Downloads, Pricing, and Technical Insights
When building an interactive calendar app, especially one that spans web, desktop, and mobile—understanding the market leaders, their adoption figures, pricing models, and core features is critical. Below is a comprehensive breakdown of the top calendar applications, organized into:

a) Popular consumer and enterprise offerings

b) Key download/install metrics

c) Subscription and pricing tiers

d) Core technical features and integrations

